    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so im trying to get way healthier and my doctor said i need to focus more on my heart health. i want to start eating way more greens like spinach and kale every single day to get those nutrients. is it okay to just go all in on a big veggie diet like that?",
      "source": "evaluator"
