      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "Ditching all other foods for just greens is not a balanced approach to heart health, though eating more greens is a fantastic start! To truly optimize your heart, you need a variety of nutrient-dense foods, not just leafy greens. Try incorporating a wide range of colorful vegetables, lean proteins, and healthy fats alongside your spinach and kale. Consistency and variety are the keys to a truly healthy heart.",
