      "content": "i get that but my doctor is always so vague about it and it's honestly just stressful checking every single leaf. i want to just commit to it so i dont have to think about it anymore. if i just keep my spinach and kale intake really high every single day, wouldn't that just stabilize things eventually? like once my body adjusts to the vitamins, it should be fine to just stay consistent with a big amount, right?",
